WEBVTT

00:05:28.074 --> 00:05:30.659
I work for a software company
specialized in data.

00:05:31.494 --> 00:05:34.914
My favorite organization I work with
at the moment is McLaren Racing.

00:05:35.664 --> 00:05:39.877
McLaren, founded in 1963
by the New Zealander Bruce McLaren.

00:05:40.378 --> 00:05:44.298
They’ve got an IndyCar team,
they have an extreme e-team.

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:47.093
They have my personal favorite,
the Formula 1 team.

00:05:47.134 --> 00:05:50.388
Just look at that livery over there,
I think it's incredible.

00:05:51.138 --> 00:05:52.807
But Bruce was an innovator.

00:05:52.848 --> 00:05:56.894
In 1963, Bruce would have never imagined

00:05:56.936 --> 00:05:59.522
that there would be
a professional gaming team,

00:05:59.522 --> 00:06:01.899
the McLaren Shadow esports team,